unshare --user --map-root-user bash
podman unshare bash


But podman unshare does extra work:

Sets up proper UID/GID mappings from /etc/subuid and /etc/subgid
Configures the user namespace for Podman's needs
Handles mount propagation correctly
Sets up storage drivers properly

